: -999px\"></font></div><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt\">- 아&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 래 -</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;<strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"> 1. 일&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;시 : 2015. 08. 12(수) ~ 08. 15(토) (3박4일)</span></strong></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong>&nbsp; 2.&nbsp;장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소 : 교원연수원 도고 (충남 아산시 소재)</strong></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong>&nbsp; 3. 지원기간 : 2015. 06. 19(금) ~ 06. 26(금) 18:00</strong></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 지원자격</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가. 교&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 사 : 전국 중·고 과학교사(경력 5년이하), 과학관련 대학원생(석사/박사 과정 중)</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 보조교사 : 전국 과학전공 대학 재학생, 기 캠프참가 대학 재학생</strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 다. 교사·보조교사의 역할 : 창의적 산출물 제작 지도 및 멘토링, 캠프생활 지원 등</strong></span></span></p><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p></span><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">&nbsp;&nbsp; 5. 지원 방법 :&nbsp;&nbsp;캠프홈페이지(</span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><a style=\"FONT-FAMILY: null\" href=\"http://www.3mco.kr/sciencecamp\">www.3mco.kr/sciencecamp</a></span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\">)에서 지원서 다운받은 후 메일 발송</span></strong></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp; </strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;※ <u>자세한 사항은 캠프홈페이지 참조</u></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u></u></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u></u></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u></u></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u></u></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u></u></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u></u></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: left; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt\"><u></u></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.5\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2015.</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZ